// nova_tools_service.nova -- NovaX Native Tools v3.0 (NovaLang Port)
// Port 9891 | Pure NovaLang port of nova_tools.py
//
// 7 Core Tools for AI models and agents:
//   1. read  -- Read file(s), with TZip compression delegate
//   2. write -- Write content to file
//   3. grep  -- Search files by pattern (basic + regex delegate)
//   4. glob  -- Find files by glob pattern
//   5. run   -- Execute command through exec_server
//   6. edit  -- Find-and-replace in files
//   7. pipe  -- Chain tool calls sequentially
//
// TMulti Composition System (20 modes across 7 tools):
//   read:  stats, diff, extract, classify
//   write: template, append, atomic
//   grep:  analyze, replace, todo
//   glob:  tree, size, recent
//   run:   safe, timed, retry
//   edit:  regex, multi
//   pipe:  parallel, conditional
//
// Ternary States:
//   +1 (T_TRUE)  = success with data
//    0 (T_MAYBE) = success but empty/partial
//   -1 (T_FALSE) = failure/error
//
// N-S Flow Routing:
//   Re < 27  (3^3)  = laminar  (clean)
//   Re < 125 (5^3)  = transitional
//   Re < 343 (7^3)  = turbulent
//   Re >= 343       = chaotic
//
// Endpoints:
//   GET  /health          -- Health check with ternary stats
//   GET  /tools/status    -- Service status + metrics
//   GET  /tools/predict   -- Markov prediction of next tool
//   GET  /multi/modes     -- Available composition modes per tool
//   POST /tools/read      -- Read file(s)
//   POST /tools/write     -- Write content to file
//   POST /tools/grep      -- Search files by pattern
//   POST /tools/glob      -- Find files by glob pattern
//   POST /tools/run       -- Execute command
//   POST /tools/edit      -- Find-and-replace in files
//   POST /tools/pipe      -- Chain tool calls
//   POST /multi           -- TMulti composition (tool + mode + args)

// ============================================================================
// SERVER INIT
// ============================================================================

